        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 370,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Adenocarcinoma of intestinal type of the vulva is a primary vulvar adenocarcinoma exhibiting intestinal differentiation.</p>\r\n",
