    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 375,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65392,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 375,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Vulva</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 463,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 376,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65393,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 376,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Most patients present with a mass or bleeding from the posterior vestibule/fourchette.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 464,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 377,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65394,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 377,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These are extremely rare vulvar neoplasms. Reported patient ages range from 42 to 69&nbsp;years {29953800}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 465,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 378,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65395,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 378,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 466,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 379,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65396,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 379,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65397,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Grossly, there is an ulcerated or polypoid mass.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65398,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The morphology is similar to that of colorectal adenocarcinoma, typically with intracytoplasmic mucin and goblet cells {29953800}. There has been a report of a case with anaplastic and spindle cell carcinomatous components with heterologous chondrosarcomatous and osteosarcomatous elements (carcinosarcoma) {28319579}. These tumours are typically positive with CK20 and CDX2.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65399,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours are not typically diagnosed by cytological methods. Cytological features are expected to be identical to those of colorectal carcinoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 382,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65400,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 382,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 472,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 385,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65401,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 385,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> primary vulvar adenocarcinoma with intestinal-type differentiation.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 470,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 383,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65402,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 383,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The staging is the same as for other vulvar carcinomas.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 471,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 384,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65403,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 397,
        "headingId": 384,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Data are limited because of the rarity of these neoplasms.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:28"
      }
    ],
